{"id":"n91756-3-7","stage":4,"title":"종 · 种","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91756-3-7-1","ko":"향수를 좀 사려고 하는데요.","zh":"我打算买点香水。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"향수를","meaning":"香水","explanation":"향수：香水；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"향수","audio":"/audio/4a187426fb98765fedd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73067","senseId":"1","lemma":"향수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"향수를","audio":"/audio/349be84f34ad8dca34a2.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"사려고","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사려고","audio":"/audio/7db1f5c48a9afc3e1343.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데요.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데요","audio":"/audio/680c4e006f96eb3e103f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4a187426fb98765f","term":"향수","zh":"香水","audio":"/audio/4a187426fb98765fedd2.mp3","entryId":"73067","definition":"喷在身体或衣服等物品上、散发香味的液体。","pronunciation":["향수"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","